{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1231122-podcast-the-immaculate-chaos","id":1231122,"title":"[Podcast] The Immaculate Chaos","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-29T08:48:34-07:00","id":1231122,"title":"[Podcast] The Immaculate Chaos","content":"Up to date information!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.theimmaculatechaos.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.theimmaculatechaos.com</a><br /> <br /> <b>Social Media</b><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where we post the all the latest news to keep our fans up to date with what is going on! </div> </div> </div>Twitter: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheImmaculateCh\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/TheImmaculateCh</a><br /> Facebook: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheImmaculateChaos\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/TheImmaculateChaos</a><br /> <br /> <b>Aggregators</b><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> We are just about every app but the below links are those where you can listen from your browser. search &quot;Immaculate Chaos&quot; in your favorite podcast app and if you don't see us post what app you use and I will try and get us where you listen! </div> </div> </div>Google Play Music: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/music/listen?u=0#/ps/Ign3hrai3yof22sgxiksuqx5q5u\" target=\"_blank\">https://play.google.com/music/listen...2sgxiksuqx5q5u</a><br /> Tumblr: <a href=\"http://immaculatechaos.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://immaculatechaos.tumblr.com/</a><br /> Sticher: <a href=\"https://www.stitcher.com/podcast/the-immaculate-chaos/immaculate-chaos\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.stitcher.com/podcast/the...maculate-chaos</a><br /> Website: <a href=\"http://www.theimmaculatechaos.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.theimmaculatechaos.com</a><br /> <br /> <b>Patreon</b><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where everyone can ask questions and comments but subscribers get uncut audio of game sessions, shirts, and so much more! </div> </div> </div>Link: <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TheImmaculateChaos\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.patreon.com/TheImmaculateChaos</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NagiSungila</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Greetings everyone!<br /> <br /> Just wanted to drop a quick post the forums to announce a new Exalted actual play podcast. We will be entering the 'studio' tomorrow to do some recording to get ourselves and our listeners up to speed with where we are and perhaps start our story. We have facebook, twitter and will be utilizing the PodBean so you will be able to find us no matter where you get your podcasts. For those, like me, new to podcasts you can install the Podbean app to your Android device and it does a decent job of helping you keep up with new and old favorites.<br /> <br /> Why name it &quot;The Immaculate Chaos&quot;?: This is actually intentional. It's meant to play off the idea of The Immaculate Order church as Exalted is all about the Anathema. In addition to this it is meant to stand for &quot;In Character&quot; as a double meaning with its' initials IC. To push that our logo is an Eye and a Chaos &quot;C&quot; in the pupil made of all the special materials in this great game. So we hope it is something you appreciate already as a fan and we hope it brings budding fans an increased measure of amusement as they come to learn the game.<br /> <br /> Actual Play: For those that don't know what that means, like i didn't, it is basically a type of podcast that means you are listening to an actual game. The events are not scripted with the players and the reactions are genuine. We do not plan to switch between games, use sound effects/gimmicks or otherwise 'doctor' our audio. We also have no plans to 'weigh in' when in comes to Exalted news or the system as a whole. There are others that have taken that focus and we would rather help build the entertainment out there than create competition.<br /> <br /> Primarily on Facebook and Twitter we are running a &quot;submit your questions&quot; campaign for the next 24 hours. When we go to record our introduction episode we are planning to answer some newbie questions and some not so 'virgin to exalted' questions. We would love to hear what you would like to know about this upcoming series as well as what you are hoping we will bring to your ears and this community. You can also leave comments here and we will link the introduction episode here for solidarity when it comes out.<br /> <br /> Thank you for taking your time to read this post and again we would love to hear your thoughts and concerns!</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Nagi Sungila, Storyteller of The Immaculate Chaos<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.theimmaculatechaos.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.theimmaculatechaos.com</a><br /> Twitter: @TheImmaculateCh<br /> Facebook: @TheImmaculateChaos","edited":{"userid":24216,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24216-nagisungila","user":"NagiSungila","date":". 10-17-2018, 09:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24216-nagisungila","name":"NagiSungila","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank